# === 1.0.0 content pass: new mob hunts, gather-and-deliver, boss contracts ===

# --- Daily: new kill ---
quest.bounty_scorpion_sweep.title = Scorpion Sweep
quest.bounty_scorpion_sweep.flavor = Scorpions have nested under the dunes and the caravans want them gone. Stamp out the swarm.
quest.bounty_cull_cactee.title = Walking Cactee
quest.bounty_cull_cactee.flavor = The cactee have pulled up their roots and started wandering the flats. Cut them down before they reach the road.
quest.bounty_toad_rumble.title = Toad Rumble
quest.bounty_toad_rumble.flavor = Rhino toads are shoving everything off the waterhole. Knock the big ones flat.
quest.bounty_hunt_crocodile.title = Crocodile Hunt
quest.bounty_hunt_crocodile.flavor = Crocs have crept into the shallows where folk cross. Clear the banks before someone loses a leg.
quest.bounty_sabertooth_hunt.title = Sabertooth Hunt
quest.bounty_sabertooth_hunt.flavor = A sabertooth pride has taken the high trail. Keep your distance and use a bow.
quest.bounty_raptor_cull.title = Raptor Cull
quest.bounty_raptor_cull.flavor = Cave raptors are hunting in packs around the dig. Thin them so the miners can work.
quest.bounty_ghoul_purge.title = Ghoul Purge
quest.bounty_ghoul_purge.flavor = Ghouls are hollowing out the old cemetery from below. Put the feeders down for good.
quest.bounty_emberwulf_hunt.title = Emberwulf Hunt
quest.bounty_emberwulf_hunt.flavor = Emberwulves set the dry pines alight wherever they run. Drop them before the ridge goes up.

# --- Daily: new gather (mine and deliver) ---
quest.bounty_mine_silver.title = Silver Consignment
quest.bounty_mine_silver.flavor = The mint is short on silver and the assayer wants a cut brought in. Work the veins, then hand a share to the board.

# --- Weekly: new kill ---
quest.bounty_weekly_fen_stalkers.title = Stalkers of the Fen
quest.bounty_weekly_fen_stalkers.flavor = Fen stalkers keep dragging livestock into the bog. Go in after them.
quest.bounty_weekly_feran_pack.title = The Feran Pack
quest.bounty_weekly_feran_pack.flavor = Feran Sharptooths have taken the ridge and jump anyone who crosses it. Hunt them down.
quest.bounty_weekly_yeti.title = Yeti of the Peaks
quest.bounty_weekly_yeti.flavor = Yetis have come down from the white peaks and the passes are no longer safe. Drive them back into the snow.
quest.bounty_weekly_trillodon.title = The Trillodon
quest.bounty_weekly_trillodon.flavor = Trillodons are trampling the jungle between the river and the ridge. Bring the brutes down.
quest.bounty_weekly_spirits.title = Restless Spirits
quest.bounty_weekly_spirits.flavor = Spirits have gathered at the elemental circles again, and they don't like visitors. Clear them out.
quest.bounty_weekly_voidspawn.title = Voidspawn Incursion
quest.bounty_weekly_voidspawn.flavor = The void is bleeding through the rift again. Cut down what crawls out before the breach widens.
objective.text.bounty.voidspawn = Defeat {0} Void Fiends
quest.bounty_weekly_mine_gold.title = Gold Quota
quest.bounty_weekly_mine_gold.flavor = Gold for the treasury, and they're counting. Mine plenty and hand over their cut.

# --- Boss hunts (hard, big payout) ---
quest.bounty_aberrant_horror.title = Aberrant Horror
quest.bounty_aberrant_horror.flavor = Something soured the dead out east, and the aberrant ones do not fall easy. Keep hitting them until they do.
quest.bounty_weekly_goblin_duke.title = The Voidtaken Grizzly
quest.bounty_weekly_goblin_duke.flavor = A Voidtaken Grizzly is loose in the Guttering Hollows. Find it with a spyglass, bait the bear trap with a Voidheart, and bring it down.
quest.bounty_weekly_shadow_knight.title = Fallen Knights
quest.bounty_weekly_shadow_knight.flavor = Skeleton knights still walk the ruins in their old armor, shields up. Take friends, and something heavy.
quest.bounty_weekly_broodmother.title = The Broodmother
quest.bounty_weekly_broodmother.flavor = Every Scarak in the dunes hatches from one swollen queen. Find her in the deep nest and kill her.

# --- Boss fights (Bounty_Encounter contracts: any scripted boss counts) ---
quest.bounty_weekly_open_warrant.title = Open Warrant
quest.bounty_weekly_open_warrant.flavor = No name on this one. Whatever is big enough to need a party will do, as long as you are still standing in the fight when it goes down.
quest.bounty_muster_roll.title = The Muster Roll
quest.bounty_muster_roll.flavor = Nobody is asking you to win. Stand in a boss fight until it is settled, whichever way it goes, and the board marks you present.
objective.text.bounty.open_warrant = Bring down {0} boss
objective.text.bounty.muster_roll = Stand in {0} boss fight to the end

